  "details": "## Description\n\nSince the game's latest update (Open Beta Unity 6), custom emojis with transparent backgrounds have been displaying incorrectly in the game.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nIf you have VRC+, add any custom emoji with a transparent background, select the \"Throw as Money\" option, and tap on it\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: Прочие\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1879-ecdbfcd219-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-07-27_16-18-55.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_367f4f37-ce77-48ce-876d-57679bdd7ea8/1/file)",
